{"id":"nichut_","lemma":"ничуть","pos":"adv","rank":3314,"glosses":["not a bit, not in the slightest, by no means"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/36/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%87%D1%83%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%87%D1%83%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Я ничуть не устал.","en":"I wasn't a bit tired.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/654012","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"not"},null]},{"text":"Тому это ничуть не понравилось.","en":"Tom didn't like it one bit.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"this / it is"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to like","l":"понравиться"}]},{"text":"Ты ничуть не лучше меня.","en":"You aren't any better than me.","words":[{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"rather, would better )"},{"g":"me","l":"я"}]},{"text":"Мне ничуть не больно.","en":"It doesn't hurt at all.","words":[{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"bad, badly"}]},{"text":"Том ничуть не похож на меня.","en":"Tom looks nothing like me.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},null,{"g":"not"},null,{"g":"on / at"},{"g":"me","l":"я"}]}]}